{"id":"n13974-1-10","stage":2,"title":"연관 · 关联","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n13974-1-10-1","ko":"경찰이 그 사람은 왜 찾아?","zh":"警察为什么要找那个人？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경찰이","meaning":"警察","explanation":"경찰：警察；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경찰","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25949","senseId":"2","lemma":"경찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경찰이","audio":"/audio/5b933614d79d0b519467.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"사람은","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람은","audio":"/audio/987448c10afe56108009.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아?","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아","audio":"/audio/e70a628817a54f0ec6b0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"642315305ad78197","term":"경찰","zh":"警察","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3","entryId":"25949","definition":"负责维持社会秩序、保护人民生命和财产安全的公务员。","pronunciation":["경ː찰"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c618